Id: con013e
Severity: ERROR
Category: tigris
Check: config

The profile given with --profile (or -p) does not exist, or its name is
not letters, digits, - and _. Profiles are files read after the tigerrc,
looked for in the profiles directory beside it, then in Tigris's own
(quick, server, desktop, container). The run stops before any check, so
that a mistyped name does not quietly audit with the wrong settings. A
profile file writable by its group or by anyone is ignored, as a tigerrc
is (con003c).
